{"uid":"db5528e678c51211","name":"test_the_router_is_never_consulted_for_a_decidable_plan_review_verdict","fullName":"tests.test_peer_plan_review_gate#test_the_router_is_never_consulted_for_a_decidable_plan_review_verdict","historyId":"3d0710e5038f71f0ea42f6861bb33f04","time":{"start":1791934999047,"stop":1791934999130,"duration":83},"description":"Deterministic-first (task 018, kept intact by task 019, and by task\n    016's deterministic undecidable-branch policy too): a plan review\n    verdict the hat DID state -- `approved`, or `objected` with a reason --\n    decides `plan_review`'s edge in `_step_plan_review` itself, without\n    ever consulting `engine.router.decide`. An undecidable reply no longer\n    reaches the router at all either (task 016) -- see\n    `test_gate_on_an_undecidable_reply_with_the_bound_spent_asks_no_router`\n    above and `tests/test_plan_review_deterministic_undecidable_task016.py`.\n\n    Stronger than task 018's version of this test in two ways: it spies on\n    `router.decide` across BOTH decidable verdicts rather than the approval\n    path alone, and it asserts the decisions file stays absent too, so a\n    router call could not hide behind a monkeypatch that missed a second\n    call site.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Deterministic-first (task 018, kept intact by task 019, and by task<br />\n016's deterministic undecidable-branch policy too): a plan review<br />\nverdict the hat DID state -- <code>approved</code>, or <code>objected</code> with a reason --<br />\ndecides <code>plan_review</code>'s edge in <code>_step_plan_review</code> itself, without<br />\never consulting <code>engine.router.decide</code>. An undecidable reply no longer<br />\nreaches the router at all either (task 016) -- see<br />\n<code>test_gate_on_an_undecidable_reply_with_the_bound_spent_asks_no_router</code><br />\nabove and <code>tests/test_plan_review_deterministic_undecidable_task016.py</code>.</p>\n<pre><code>Stronger than task 018's version of this test in two ways: it spies on\n`router.decide` across BOTH decidable verdicts rather than the approval\npath alone, and it asserts the decisions file stays absent too, so a\nrouter call could not hide behind a monkeypatch that missed a second\ncall site.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791934845957,"stop":1791934845957,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791934845957,"stop":1791934845957,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791934999040,"stop":1791934999040,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791934999040,"stop":1791934999042,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791934999042,"stop":1791934999044,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791934999042,"stop":1791934999042,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasConten